{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24911","headline":"嵩山望幸 · 薛存诚","name":"嵩山望幸","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峻极位何崇，方知造化功。\n降灵逢圣主，望幸表维嵩。\n隐映连青壁，嵯峨向碧空。\n象车因叶瑞，龙驾愿升中。\n万岁声长在，千岩气转雄。\n东都歌盛事，西笑伫皇风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛存诚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}